Spectrum Studio color engine
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Portions of the color engine in src/math, src/scales, src/modes, and src/theme
are adapted from the Spectrum Studio color system in the Spectrum Design Data
project (https://github.com/adobe/spectrum-design-data,
docs/spectrum-studio/src/features/color-system).

Copyright 2026 Adobe. All rights reserved.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Files adapted from that source keep the original "Copyright 2026 Adobe"
header. They were changed to remove application UI, state, storage, and
data-visualization code, and to add APCA support and a standalone theme API.

